00:04:11.118 --> 00:04:15.122 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Parfait." J'ai dit : "Il y amoe

00:04:13.153 --> 00:04:16.156 size:53% position:73% line:53%
dit : "Regarde, je m'occupe de

00:04:14.187 --> 00:04:17.190 size:53% position:73% line:53%
