00:04:16.256 --> 00:04:21.194 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Ce temps-là t'appartient. Mais

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:22.229 size:53% position:73% line:53%
prends-le et fais-en quelquecho:

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:23.263 size:53% position:73% line:53%
"Parfait." Et là, je suis parti

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:24.298 size:53% position:73% line:53%
