00:04:22.329 --> 00:04:25.332 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Gros soutien psychologique,

00:04:23.363 --> 00:04:27.067 size:53% position:73% line:53%
professionnels de la santé au

00:04:24.398 --> 00:04:28.068 size:53% position:73% line:53%
