00:04:39.479 --> 00:04:42.883 size:53% position:73% line:53%
C'est trop gros. C'est ci, c'est

00:04:40.947 --> 00:04:43.917 size:53% position:73% line:53%
ça." Elle fait : "OK, mais

00:04:41.948 --> 00:04:44.951 size:53% position:73% line:53%
reprmimimimimimimimimimin que tu

00:04:42.983 --> 00:04:46.887 size:53% position:73% line:53%
