00:04:45.051 --> 00:04:50.390 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Elle dit : "Abandonne pas."

00:04:46.987 --> 00:04:51.391 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Et cette fois-là,

00:04:48.588 --> 00:04:52.426 size:53% position:73% line:53%
